{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう9月なのだから\nさすがに夏もおしまいか…と"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大人しく、\n秋を迎える心の準備を始めたはいいものの"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんだかんだ東京は\n今週また、30℃まで気温が上がる日もあるみたいだし"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なーんだ、\n9月だってまだまだ夏ですね😗🎐"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "と、いうことはこれはもう、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏生まれと言ってもいいのでは…？と\n淡い期待を抱き始めました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "宮城県出身 21歳⋆.˚\n四期生の山川宇衣（やまかわうい）です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひとつ前のブログでも触れたけれど、改めて…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日、\n櫻坂に加入してから二度目のお誕生日を迎えました🍓✦·.⋆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日もケーキをいただいちゃった\nうれしいーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミーグリやレターでお祝いしてくださったみなさんも、ありがとうございました🥲✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あれは遡ること21年前…\n前日の18日はちょうど満月ののぼる日で"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたしはそんな 満月の夜が明けた頃、\n19日の朝方に生まれました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちょうどお月見の季節の\n満月の夜明けに生まれたわたしは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "生粋の秋生まれとでも言わんばかりの\n生誕を遂げたわけですが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんといっても\n夏が好きなわたしは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やっぱりどうしても、\n夏生まれというものに憧れがあったり…🍉"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも思い返すと、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちょっと前までは\n好きな季節を聞かれたら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「春か秋」って答えていた気がします🫢🫢"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気温がちょうどいいから〜\nとか言って🫢"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それなのに、\nいつからこんなに夏が好きになったんだろう、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たぶん夏が好きになるよりも先に、\n寒さが苦手になったことがある気がするな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "好きなものって案外簡単に\n変わっていくものですね〜🌸🍂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来年には冬が好きとか言ってるかも🫢❄️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "好きなもの、更新されたら報告しますね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さてさてそれでは\nここらで21歳の抱負を…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたしには、行動を起こす前に\nあれこれ考えてしまう癖があって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "考えた挙句結局やめちゃう、\nなんてこともよくあるんですね😮‍💨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これって悪い癖だなぁと\n最近しみじみ思っていたので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "21歳のわたしは、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「考える前に行動」！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これでいきます　✊🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もちろん、\n慎重に考えるべきことも見極めつつ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ある程度勢いも大事にしながら\n思い立ったら行動！でいけたらいいなと思っています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんだか自然と、\n実りのある年になりそうじゃないですか？( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "がんばるぞーー✊🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんか、改めて\n21歳かぁ、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "口に出すと数字が身に沁みるけど、\nまだまだ自分のものじゃないみたいで\n不思議な気持ちです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分が持つ感覚以上に\n実際の自分は歳を重ねていて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そのことを きっと必要以上に\n複雑に考えようとする自分もいるけれど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだ子供のままでいたいな、とか\nいい加減大人にならなきゃな、とか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そういうの全部ひっくるめて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ピーターパンに\nぎゅっと包み込んでもらいました🧚"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ん？ピーターパン？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まあまあ、\nとにかくそんなことがあったのです😌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この気持ちを忘れたくないですね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobctnukw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めまして、21歳もよろしくお願いします\n🦢🍓🍈"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね2️⃣1️⃣⭐️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うい　#53通目"}], "source": "official"}